{"post": true, "caption": "Win rate alone tells you nothing. What matters is win rate times average win, minus loss rate times average loss.\nA 40% trader can out-earn a 70% trader if the losses stay small and the winners are allowed to run.\nCheck your journal: what's your average win vs your average loss?\n\nEducation only. Not financial advice.\n\n#CandleAndCode #MythVsReality #RiskReward #TradingPsychology #TradingPH", "tag": "// myth vs reality", "footer": "Education only. Not financial advice.", "bpm": 92, "scenes": [{"type": "hook", "dur": 2.4, "size": 130, "lines": [{"t": "70% WINS.", "c": "green"}, {"t": "STILL LOSING.", "c": "red"}]}, {"type": "text", "dur": 3.0, "size": 90, "lines": [{"t": "Myth:", "c": "muted"}, {"t": "More wins,", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "more money.", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "Tingnan natin.", "c": "green"}]}, {"type": "bars", "dur": 5.0, "title": "Trader A: 70% wins", "subtitle": "10 trades | win P300, lose P1,000", "rows": [{"l": "7 wins", "v": 2100, "vl": "+P2,100", "lc": "fg", "bc": "green"}, {"l": "3 losses", "v": 3000, "vl": "-P3,000", "lc": "fg", "bc": "red"}]}, {"type": "stat", "dur": 2.6, "label": "Trader A, net", "value": "-P900", "note": "Right 7 times. Still down.", "c": "red"}, {"type": "bars", "dur": 5.0, "title": "Trader B: 40% wins", "subtitle": "10 trades | win P2,000, lose P1,000", "rows": [{"l": "4 wins", "v": 8000, "vl": "+P8,000", "lc": "fg", "bc": "green"}, {"l": "6 losses", "v": 6000, "vl": "-P6,000", "lc": "fg", "bc": "red"}]}, {"type": "stat", "dur": 2.6, "label": "Trader B, net", "value": "+P2,000", "size": 170, "note": "Wrong 6 times. Still up.", "c": "green"}, {"type": "text", "dur": 3.0, "size": 88, "lines": [{"t": "Win rate is half.", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "Win SIZE is the rest.", "c": "green"}]}, {"type": "code", "dur": 4.0, "lines": [{"t": "if (avg_win < avg_loss) {", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "  // 70% won't save you", "c": "muted"}, {"t": "  return fix_exits();", "c": "green"}, {"t": "}", "c": "fg"}]}, {"type": "end", "dur": 2.2, "line": "// trade with a system, not a feeling"}]}